("curvature","configuration","{\"title\":\"A different light\",\"kicker\":\"WORLDWRIGHT / COMPOSABLE EXPERIENCE\",\"intro\":\"Each layer can be used, replaced or omitted independently in the source. Presets compose those choices; they do not replace the world’s evidence.\",\"storageKey\":\"worldwright.curvature.starter.v1\",\"dimensions\":[{\"id\":\"colours\",\"kind\":\"tokens\",\"label\":\"Colours\",\"options\":[{\"id\":\"shallows\",\"label\":\"Warm shallows\",\"tokens\":[{\"name\":\"--ww-paper\",\"value\":\"#f3efe4\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-ink\",\"value\":\"#163c3c\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-surface\",\"value\":\"#fffcf3\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-accent\",\"value\":\"#005c60\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-line\",\"value\":\"#739b91\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-muted\",\"value\":\"#496969\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-scene-ink\",\"value\":\"#fff8e8\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-scene-scrim\",\"value\":\"linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(8,35,39,.85),rgba(8,35,39,.18))\"}]},{\"id\":\"midnight\",\"label\":\"Midnight water\",\"tokens\":[{\"name\":\"--ww-paper\",\"value\":\"#091a26\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-ink\",\"value\":\"#e7f3ed\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-surface\",\"value\":\"#102d3b\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-accent\",\"value\":\"#9de0cf\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-line\",\"value\":\"#5d8294\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-muted\",\"value\":\"#b1cccf\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-scene-ink\",\"value\":\"#ecfff4\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-scene-scrim\",\"value\":\"linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(4,16,34,.87),rgba(4,16,34,.22))\"}]},{\"id\":\"salt\",\"label\":\"Salt & graphite\",\"tokens\":[{\"name\":\"--ww-paper\",\"value\":\"#eeeee8\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-ink\",\"value\":\"#292f32\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-surface\",\"value\":\"#fafaf5\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-accent\",\"value\":\"#7d3427\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-line\",\"value\":\"#8c9290\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-muted\",\"value\":\"#545f60\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-scene-ink\",\"value\":\"#fff\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-scene-scrim\",\"value\":\"linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(25,29,31,.85),rgba(25,29,31,.2))\"}]}]},{\"id\":\"shapes\",\"kind\":\"tokens\",\"label\":\"Shapes\",\"options\":[{\"id\":\"pool\",\"label\":\"Eroded pools\",\"tokens\":[{\"name\":\"--ww-radius\",\"value\":\"2.4rem .6rem 2.4rem .6rem\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-cut\",\"value\":\"none\"}]},{\"id\":\"chart\",\"label\":\"Cut survey corners\",\"tokens\":[{\"name\":\"--ww-radius\",\"value\":\"0\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-cut\",\"value\":\"polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 20px) 0,100% 20px,100% 100%,20px 100%,0 calc(100% - 20px))\"}]},{\"id\":\"square\",\"label\":\"Plain edges\",\"tokens\":[{\"name\":\"--ww-radius\",\"value\":\".15rem\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-cut\",\"value\":\"none\"}]}]},{\"id\":\"mood\",\"kind\":\"mood\",\"label\":\"Mood & typography\",\"options\":[{\"id\":\"curious\",\"label\":\"Curious / open\",\"tokens\":[{\"name\":\"--ww-heading-font\",\"value\":\"Georgia, serif\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-air\",\"value\":\"clamp(1.6rem,5vw,4rem)\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-tracking\",\"value\":\"-.04em\"}],\"heading\":\"Look closely. Leave room for wonder.\",\"description\":\"A small inlet, a shared notebook, and more than one way to begin.\"},{\"id\":\"reflective\",\"label\":\"Reflective / spacious\",\"tokens\":[{\"name\":\"--ww-heading-font\",\"value\":\"Georgia, serif\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-air\",\"value\":\"clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem)\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-tracking\",\"value\":\"-.015em\"}],\"heading\":\"Stay with what you have noticed.\",\"description\":\"Some questions become clearer when we give them a little more time.\"},{\"id\":\"precise\",\"label\":\"Precise / measured\",\"tokens\":[{\"name\":\"--ww-heading-font\",\"value\":\"ui-monospace, monospace\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-air\",\"value\":\"clamp(1.3rem,4vw,3rem)\"},{\"name\":\"--ww-tracking\",\"value\":\"-.045em\"}],\"heading\":\"Notice. Compare. Revise.\",\"description\":\"Make the observation explicit, keep its source, and test what follows.\"}]},{\"id\":\"chrome\",\"kind\":\"tokens\",\"label\":\"Chrome & framing\",\"options\":[{\"id\":\"instrument\",\"label\":\"Brass instrument\",\"tokens\":[{\"name\":\"--ww-border\",\"value\":\"3px double var(--ww-line)\"},{